omi","address":"3214 Burgundy St","city":"New Orleans","state":"LA","postal_code":"70117","stars":5.0,"review_count":24,"categories":["Japanese","Restaurants"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"3lbhIJ8i-dHzMNtC-FW8tA","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":889,"mm_rank":765,"target_category_support_fraction":0.5,"selected_image_count":5,"label_diversity":1,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Japanese","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3lbhIJ8i-dHzMNtC-FW8tA","review_id":"cEIQ_3km78nL7zMK9qXInA","date":"2021-04-23T04:56:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9542989730834961,"text_excerpt":"Nagomi was freaking amazing. Wow. It's really hard to get a reservation here, but I believe they open them up at the end of each month through Resy. If you are able to get a spot, definitely get it. All the ingredients were so fresh, the our server was super entertaining and personable, and the food was so amazing. I honestly lost count of how many courses there were after the first few, but I think there were 10 overall including a dessert - not pictured. It is chef select omakase, so the only thing you are able to pick during the experience is what you want to drink. Some wine and beer options and PLENTY of sake. the chef's table seats 14 people, and there are some smaller tables agains..."},{"business_id":"3lbhIJ8i-dHzMNtC-FW8tA","review_id":"ORN8o4qlt5l1U8E6iuxXpQ","date":"2021-06-24T21:23:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9390435814857483,"text_excerpt":"I would say Nagomi was probably the only OG True Japanese sushi place I have visited in the city so far. I have not been to the other Omakase restaurant yet but It really was the best bite of sushi I have ever had. I mean everybody knows that what we usually see at a Japanese Restaurant is most likely americanized sushi and rolls. Big Tempura, cream cheese, crunchy topping with mayo drizzled everywhere... - a.k.a the fillers to make your roll actually look bigger... You will not find that at Nagomi. Each course comes with 2 sushi pieces (Except Poke) and I really L O V E that the ratio of rice to the fish piece is so perfect. I do not know how many courses we had but even after all that s..."},{"business_id":"3lbhIJ8i-dHzMNtC-FW8tA","review_id":"l7ATHOuXhfISj04ITCmS6Q","date":"2020-02-14T14:08:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9331626892089844,"text_excerpt":"Tucked in the Bywater, this restaurant takes you out of the city and brings you a little slice of Japan. This is a 12 seater, reservation only, omakase experience with 2 seatings a night. Every night is different so my experience will vary from yours. Chef Kaz presented us with 2 appetizers, 7 courses of sushi (2pcs per person), and dessert. Every bite melted in my mouth bursting with flavors and so much umami. It was delectable and filling. I did not leave this hungry! And it was affordable. I'm already trying to book a reservation for my next time."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3lbhIJ8i-dHzMNtC-FW8tA","photo_id":"L9ZxH9vYwziVxM9aTkLQ1g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/L9ZxH9vYwziVxM9aTkLQ1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9562497138977051},{"business_id":"3lbhIJ8i-dHzMNtC-FW8tA","photo_id":"hgUD_-dictHFeAqexvAUNw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hgUD_-dictHFeAqexvAUNw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9471800923347473},{"business_id":"3lbhIJ8i-dHzMNtC-FW8tA","photo_id":"I0m9yj-BzrzDFhC29yJQEw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/I0m9yj-BzrzDFhC29yJQEw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9308015704154968},{"business_id":"3lbhIJ8i-dHzMNtC-FW8tA","photo_id":"FQF-wzwKTcp2lIbSJC8A0A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/FQF-wzwKTcp2lIbSJC8A0A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9182850122451782},{"business_id":"3lbhIJ8i-dHzMNtC-FW8tA","photo_id":"QScIE70s2Ihcm7zI0b6kIw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QScIE70s2Ihcm7zI0b6kIw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9085264801979065}]},"notebook_case":null}
